      "writtenOn": "2024-12-09T19:44:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "pvmfw from Android 15 \u0026 above must be built with `cfg!(llpvm_changes)` enabled. These were (trunk stable related) feature flags in Android 15. The idea was, since these are desert release features, these will be incrementally enabled staging branches \u0026 then trunk branches.\n\n\n@ioffe@google.com knows a lot more about these flags, but IIUC, the code you submit here will not be auto-backported to any Android 15 trunk branches with llpvm_disabled (I expect all of them to have llpvm_changes enabled).",
      "parentUuid": "bc2a09e3_0c36d5db",
      "range": {
